        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"d6526906-e79e-4ec0-a6e3-99d2ada3b461\",\"review_text\":\"Love me some spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"cb0de46d-11b8-43de-b208-51501eee857a\",\"review_text\":\"Nothing. After I registered and pay premium mini I can't play or add, open profile of my account. How it this even possible? Plus daily mox from Spotify aslo marked as empty\"},{\"review_id\":\"3aa0c0ee-3a92-47f1-b63a-b498e318ea40\",\"review_text\":\"Very cheap subscription 👏 👌\"},{\"review_id\":\"fdd14d46-b9d5-4b51-b355-fb766ec54d05\",\"review_text\":\"I updated my app and anytime I'm listening to a playlist, I don't hear sounds from subsequent songs unless I uninstall and reinstall which is quite absurb please fix it\"},{\"review_id\":\"499c6308-3c90-49be-93e2-9a7f49af4e4a\",\"review_text\":\"This is the best music app that I've ever used in my life (and it'll be the best for the rest of it)\"},{\"review_id\":\"0335ab02-832f-45ce-b827-092ef2aa6c50\",\"review_text\":\"Really spotify gone bad after this recent update i really hate this, I'm uninstalling, because there are no lyrics at all, the biggest reason why I'm using this app is because of lyrics but now!!!??!!! hate you spotify -_-|| i really loved you before\"},{\"review_id\":\"5ffc3e7b-b2d8-4ef8-b228-fb5be2478acb\",\"review_text\":\"This app is very cool and we can listen good music with low internet speed but I am giving this 4 star because there are so many add and it irritates .\"},{\"review_id\":\"266369d8-3594-46ba-a2bd-5bf0bcd756ac\",\"review_text\":\"Ban Spotify for support sweaden\"},{\"review_id\":\"1a9919db-d3e0-442c-9bc5-87f311345c59\",\"review_text\":\"Great rhAnks3\"},{\"review_id\":\"945884c2-60b2-4063-bf34-48fe6d26026a\",\"review_text\":\"Can't even open. Keeps saying there was an error\"}]}"
